 information are display to align more neatly", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:58:06Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae8616fbcd3ef6fb1c0bc998031513ba1945559f", "message": "Merge pull request #6 from CatHuyuH24/fix/fetch-album-fragment\n\nFix Issue #5: Prevent unwanted onResume execution in AlbumFragment", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:26:02Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a1802b231a642d38d3729921cc37b4a2f9d0fdfb", "message": "Merge branch 'main' into fix/fetch-album-fragment", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:23:31Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a0b15104353a238ee78112649ba80710ab5fc19c", "message": "update app's icon, image's date\n\n- Change app's icon to be group number as requested\n- Modify such that when swiping to change image, the 'Date' information on the top is also updated\n- Update UI: make the Date information on the top and to the right-side (end-side), update the layout of\n'back' button", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:15:00Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1a63fb97cfb3213ff10772b2e280a1dc1835bf24", "message": "chore: minor refactor", "created_at": "2024-12-08T09:14:52Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71f899700d9507990becc2e9d95d8d66ae231550", "message": "refactor soloImageActivity.java", "created_at": "2024-12-08T08:42:04Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "349257cda8375fd8344b49b21aae8727a2c07555", "message": "update UI\n\n- Turn \"Back\" button to an arrow-shaped on top left\n- Update the display of each image (when first pressed in) to be the date taken\n- Turn the \"Next\" and \"Previous\" button to be the sliding of the screen instead", "created_at": "2024-12-08T07:58:42Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e29c4408552484e80c376910527da65f9334e929", "message": "fix Picture Fragment layout to break lines", "created_at": "2024-12-07T17:07:04Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "745b470203048585a4a8778590d4b3ff503fce6d", "message": "chore: update the display deletion-asking-message", "created_at": "2024-11-30T16:05:53Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3cdcd3fb02d1ae765520013a553c4e4ae0113881", "message": "refactor: make permission request a function\n\n- Add request for writing permission if not have\n- Refactor the code lines into a function to avoid repetition and increase modularity", "created_at": "2024-11-30T15:57:21Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1b5113faf5bc1a34e178fe2f921729cf404238b9", "message": "feat: delete cropped image\n\n- Utilize ContentResolver or File to delete the image\n- Handle RecoverableSecurityException when needs permission to delete\n- Notify users to allow to delete images", "created_at": "2024-11-30T15:50:21Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "12e2dd0037c816290e46ebfc2bcc0504cb591397", "message": "feat: chosing position to display as bg img\n\n- Update the setBackground button in SoloImageActivity to allow user to crop\n(choose position via a frame) the image to set as the background\n- Currently, the cropped image is still being saved to the device, will fix this\n(because using the built-in crop functionality rather than a 3rd party library,\nwhich aligns well with the scope of the project)", "created_at": "2024-11-29T17:18:47Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ecfb1deb4103b5efc3c390097f75a77162d4a939", "message": "Merge pull request #3 from CatHuyuH24/feature/ui-thread-optimization\n\nImage processing avoids collision with UI-Thread", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:05:58Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab82958ea6cb5fdbc948e33614a4fd6f460bea78", "message": "Merge pull request #2 from CatHuyuH24/feature/solo-activity-album\n\nFeature: Display and Manage Images in SoloActivity and Album", "created_at": "2024-11-29T10:04:06Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a34d8aa5d8493142a2b97bf1ab82747f1800c008", "message": "feat: add set background\n\nAllow to set the current image (in SoloImageActivity) to be the\nbackground (home screen) of the device.", "created_at": "2024-11-18T15:59:42Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5fdf2fdd79fc2ea7e778c4f51140358358b6775d", "message": "fix: not showing when pressed on image (SoloImageActivity)", "created_at": "2024-11-18T15:45:31Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c1bf19d86f8e26ec48751be68d7522e1ac47f35c", "message": "Create README.md\n\ninit README", "created_at": "2024-11-12T14:07:43Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dea6d2920dea328c2552a41cc01af014fe23dbe9", "message": "Add 'set-background' functionality, adjust button to CompatButton, improve buttons' UI\n\nChanged the UI a bit, making it look nicer by adding colors to the button; still needs more beautification; used AppCompatButton instead of Button for better compatibility with old version (especially this, we're asked to develop with the minSdk = 29 - API = 29 - Android 10.0)\nAdded the functionality to set the home screen as the current image, when exiting the application, the home screen still persists. The option to set image as the lock screen may be another button (another functionality rather than included inside the 'set background' functionality).\nAfter this, need to add animation for transition to the next and previous images ('Next' and 'Previous' buttons).\nAbout the 'set background' functionality, maybe need to add a loading screen when the image is being processed? And/or allow user to choose angle, position of the image to be set?", "created_at": "2024-10-21T10:37:12Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b140d36ca83890e735439ed4ebb205da94b5791b", "message": "delete unused imports", "created_at": "2024-10-21T06:26:52Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "afbbd4a8d38e9ca99337951973baf7228bee248e", "message": "add zoom-in when press on thumbnails and \"Back\" button\n\nadd a new 'SoloImageActivity.java' for the purpose of displaying the image by itself when pressed on (essentially zooming in on that image). The reason a whole new activity is started is that for:\n1. when implementing the \"Back\" button, only needs to call \"finish()\" (as can also be seen in the src code)\n2. Inside each zoomed-in frame, there are (potentially) many other features like set as background, next image, previous image, (filter??)\n=> Henceforth, it's better to make a whole separate activity rather than make a pop-up layer on top of the main one\nNeeded to add the \"SoloImageActivity\" into the Manifest file, which the AI overlooked; this seriously impeded the progress...", "created_at": "2024-10-21T06:25:36Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5c2c1e5fdf1b53ed3ea50c5b05c0d424beb044c3", "message": "delete redundant comments in 'solo_picture.xml'\n\nfor some reasons, when leave the comments, keep receive errors and warning; so I've deleted them...", "created_at": "2024-10-21T02:29:48Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "514b9dda2b2121d1af4745f67e2061ec6280925a", "message": "added xml for solo picture, initial buttons design\n\nadded a 'solo_picture.xml' file to display a big, single picture. This is to be implemented in the future when a small-version of an image (called a 'thumbnail') from the picture fragment is pressed on, that thumbnail will transition to this frame, showing the whole big image, the title, as well as the option to go back, to set as background or 'next'. The placement (the design) of buttons inside 'solo_picture.xml' is only draft, will be adjusted if needed in the future", "created_at": "2024-10-21T02:28:09Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9a403fdd9065e5f796001f0edba1cc12cf99abfe", "message": "first commit\n\nHuynh added the commits made by Khiem", "created_at": "2024-10-21T00:25:08Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d3f16048f8570a9e65392c661b0a00f49131275f", "message": "first commit\n\nHuynh added the commits made by Khiem", "created_at": "2024-10-21T00:24:06Z", "repo": "Mobile_programming_22_3", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "50c8186ee7ba7d564c071f0e87342c4a850354d8", "message": "minor fixes", "created_at": "2024-12-10T17:47:09Z", "repo": "WAD_KHK_Superstore", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59085cd59ebbb9638c879ab57df5718f4ed21856", "message": "validate quantity at cart.ejs", "created_at": "2024-12-04T17:30:47Z", "repo":